{
 "vak": "Wiskunde basis",
 "titel": "Tweedegraadsvergelijkingen algebraïsch oplossen",
 "onder": "Vierkantsvergelijkingen oplossen met de discriminant of door te ontbinden, en ze gebruiken in vraagstukken.",
 "secties": [
  {
   "kop": "Onvolledige vierkantsvergelijkingen",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Een vierkantsvergelijking heeft de vorm \\(ax^{2}+bx+c=0\\) met \\(a\\neq 0\\). Is \\(b=0\\) of \\(c=0\\), dan is ze <strong>onvolledig</strong>, zoals \\(3x^{2}-12=0\\). Die los je snel op:"
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">vorm</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">aanpak</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">voorbeeld</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(ax^{2}+c=0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{2}\\) alleen zetten, dan worteltrekken (twee tekens!)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{2}=49\\): \\(V=\\{-7,7\\}\\); \\(4x^{2}=100\\): \\(x=\\pm 5\\); \\(-x^{2}+4=0\\): \\(x=\\pm 2\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">is \\(x^{2}\\) negatief, dan is er geen oplossing</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{2}+9=0\\): \\(V=\\varnothing\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(ax^{2}+bx=0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x\\) buiten haakjes: \\(x(ax+b)=0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{2}-5x=0\\): \\(x(x-5)=0\\), \\(V=\\{0,5\\}\\); \\(3x^{2}-6x=0\\): \\(V=\\{0,2\\}\\)</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Deel <strong>nooit</strong> beide leden door \\(x\\): dan verlies je de oplossing \\(0\\). Zo heeft \\(x^{2}=3x\\) de oplossingen \\(0\\) en \\(3\\), niet alleen \\(3\\)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "De discriminant",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<p style='text-align:center'><strong>\\(D=b^{2}-4ac\\)</strong> &nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>\\(x=\\dfrac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\)</strong></p>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">\\(D\\)</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">aantal oplossingen</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">parabool</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(D>0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">twee</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">snijdt de \\(x\\)-as twee keer</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(D=0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">één: \\(x=-\\dfrac{b}{2a}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">raakt de \\(x\\)-as in haar top</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(D<0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">geen</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">raakt de \\(x\\)-as niet</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "figuur",
     "html": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 470 186\" width=\"470\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"8.0\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"140.7\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#e4ded0\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polyline points=\"15.0,42.0 18.3,53.9 21.6,65.1 24.9,75.6 28.2,85.5 31.5,94.6 34.8,103.1 38.1,110.9 41.4,118.0 44.7,124.5 48.0,130.3 51.3,135.4 54.6,139.8 57.9,143.5 61.1,146.6 64.4,148.9 67.7,150.6 71.0,151.7 74.3,152.0 77.6,151.7 80.9,150.6 84.2,148.9 87.5,146.6 90.8,143.5 94.1,139.8 97.4,135.4 100.7,130.3 104.0,124.5 107.3,118.0 110.6,110.9 113.9,103.1 117.2,94.6 120.5,85.5 123.8,75.6 127.1,65.1 130.4,53.9 133.7,42.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f5d50\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"44.4\" cy=\"124\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#c17f2b\"/><circle cx=\"104.3\" cy=\"124\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#c17f2b\"/><text x=\"74.3\" y=\"24.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#234539\">D &gt; 0</text><text x=\"74.3\" y=\"172.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6b7260\">twee nulwaarden</text><line x1=\"168.7\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"301.3\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#e4ded0\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polyline points=\"175.7,42.0 179.0,50.9 182.3,59.2 185.6,67.1 188.9,74.4 192.1,81.2 195.4,87.6 198.7,93.4 202.0,98.7 205.3,103.5 208.6,107.8 211.9,111.6 215.2,114.9 218.5,117.7 221.8,120.0 225.1,121.7 228.4,123.0 231.7,123.7 235.0,124.0 238.3,123.7 241.6,123.0 244.9,121.7 248.2,120.0 251.5,117.7 254.8,114.9 258.1,111.6 261.4,107.8 264.7,103.5 268.0,98.7 271.3,93.4 274.6,87.6 277.9,81.2 281.1,74.4 284.4,67.1 287.7,59.2 291.0,50.9 294.3,42.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f5d50\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"235.0\" cy=\"124\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#c17f2b\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"24.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#234539\">D = 0</text><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"172.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6b7260\">één nulwaarde</text><line x1=\"329.3\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"462.0\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#e4ded0\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polyline points=\"336.3,42.0 339.6,48.3 342.9,54.2 346.2,59.7 349.5,64.9 352.8,69.7 356.1,74.2 359.4,78.3 362.7,82.1 366.0,85.5 369.3,88.5 372.6,91.2 375.9,93.6 379.2,95.5 382.5,97.1 385.8,98.4 389.1,99.3 392.4,99.8 395.7,100.0 399.0,99.8 402.3,99.3 405.6,98.4 408.9,97.1 412.1,95.5 415.4,93.6 418.7,91.2 422.0,88.5 425.3,85.5 428.6,82.1 431.9,78.3 435.2,74.2 438.5,69.7 441.8,64.9 445.1,59.7 448.4,54.2 451.7,48.3 455.0,42.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f5d50\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"395.7\" y=\"24.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#234539\">D &lt; 0</text><text x=\"395.7\" y=\"172.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6b7260\">geen nulwaarden</text></svg>",
     "onderschrift": "Twee, één of geen snijpunten met de \\(x\\)-as."
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<ul><li>\\(2x^{2}+3x-2=0\\): \\(D=9+16=25\\), \\(x=\\dfrac{-3\\pm 5}{4}\\), dus \\(V=\\left\\{-2,\\tfrac{1}{2}\\right\\}\\).</li><li>\\(x^{2}-2x-15=0\\): \\(D=4+60=64\\), \\(x=\\dfrac{2\\pm 8}{2}\\), dus \\(V=\\{-3,5\\}\\).</li><li>\\(x^{2}-6x+9=0\\): \\(D=0\\), één oplossing \\(x=3\\).</li><li>\\(x^{2}+x+1=0\\): \\(D=1-4=-3<0\\), geen oplossing.</li><li>\\(x^{2}+4x-1=0\\): \\(D=20\\), \\(x=\\dfrac{-4\\pm\\sqrt{20}}{2}\\approx 0{,}24\\) of \\(-4{,}24\\).</li><li>\\(x^{2}+4x+c=0\\) met \\(D=0\\): \\(16-4c=0\\), dus \\(c=4\\).</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Een vierkantsvergelijking heeft dus nooit meer dan twee oplossingen."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "Ontbinden in factoren",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Een product is nul als een van de factoren nul is. \\((x-2)(x+7)=0\\) geeft \\(x=2\\) of \\(x=-7\\). Maar \\((x-2)(x+7)=8\\) mag je zo <strong>niet</strong> oplossen: werk eerst uit tot \\(\\ldots=0\\)."
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">ontbinding</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">voorbeeld</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">verschil van twee kwadraten: \\(a^{2}-b^{2}=(a-b)(a+b)\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{2}-16=(x-4)(x+4)\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">som-productmethode: zoek twee getallen met som \\(b\\) en product \\(c\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{2}+5x+6=(x+2)(x+3)\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{2}-7x+10=(x-2)(x-5)\\): nulwaarden \\(2\\) en \\(5\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{2}+2x-24=(x+6)(x-4)\\): positieve oplossing \\(4\\)</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "\\((x-1)^{2}=16\\) los je op door worteltrekken: \\(x-1=\\pm 4\\), dus \\(V=\\{-3,5\\}\\)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "Snijpunten van twee grafieken",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Je lost \\(f(x)=g(x)\\) op en berekent bij elke oplossing de functiewaarde. \\(x^{2}=x+6\\) geeft \\(x^{2}-x-6=0\\), \\((x-3)(x+2)=0\\): \\(x=-2\\) of \\(x=3\\)."
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "\\(x^{2}+1=0\\) heeft geen oplossing, dus de parabool \\(y=x^{2}+1\\) en de rechte \\(y=0\\) hebben geen snijpunt. \\(x^{2}+1=2x\\) geeft \\((x-1)^{2}=0\\): de rechte \\(y=2x\\) <strong>raakt</strong> de parabool in één punt."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "Vraagstukken",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">vraagstuk</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">vergelijking</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">antwoord</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">rechthoek \\(3\\) cm langer dan breed, oppervlakte \\(40\\ \\text{cm}^{2}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x(x+3)=40\\), \\(x^{2}+3x-40=0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x=5\\) (\\(-8\\) valt weg)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">steen valt \\(5t^{2}\\) meter; wanneer \\(45\\) m?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(5t^{2}=45\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(t=3\\) s</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">som van een positief getal en zijn kwadraat is \\(30\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{2}+x-30=0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(5\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">vierkant tuintje met pad van \\(1\\) m, samen \\(49\\ \\text{m}^{2}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((x+2)^{2}=49\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x=5\\) m</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">bal \\(h(t)=-5t^{2}+20t\\) op \\(15\\) m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(-5t^{2}+20t=15\\), \\(t^{2}-4t+3=0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">na \\(1\\) s en na \\(3\\) s</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">wanneer terug op de grond?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(-5t^{2}+20t=0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">na \\(4\\) s</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">winst \\(W(q)=-q^{2}+50q-400\\) nul</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(q^{2}-50q+400=0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(q=10\\) en \\(q=40\\)</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Controleer altijd of een oplossing in de situatie past. Een lengte kan niet negatief zijn: een negatieve oplossing van de vergelijking is dan geen antwoord."
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
 "onthoud": [
  "\\(ax^{2}+c=0\\): worteltrekken, met \\(\\pm\\). \\(ax^{2}+bx=0\\): \\(x\\) buiten haakjes.",
  "Nooit delen door \\(x\\): je verliest de oplossing \\(0\\).",
  "\\(D=b^{2}-4ac\\); \\(x=\\dfrac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\). \\(D>0\\): twee, \\(D=0\\): één, \\(D<0\\): geen.",
  "Een product is nul als een factor nul is; eerst alles naar één lid.",
  "Snijpunten: los \\(f(x)=g(x)\\) op.",
  "Controleer of de oplossing in de situatie zin heeft."
 ]
}